            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Why Metsera is 'in better hands' with Pfizer than Novo Nordisk",
            "description": "<p>Pfizer (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PFE\">PFE</a>) has beat out Novo Nordisk (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVO\">NVO</a>) in the bidding war for obesity medicine company Metsera (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MTSR\">MTSR</a>).</p>\n<p>BMO Capital Markets managing director of biopharma equity research, Evan Seigerman, discusses why he thinks the acquisition worked out in the best way for all parties.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
